<title>POLAND: REMAK NOV NET LOSS RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>REMAK NOV NET LOSS RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.42 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.42 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.55 vs   0.35</p>
<p> Sales		    4.66 vs   8.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.33 vs   1.98</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.33 vs   4.19</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.91 vs   4.47 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   65.89 vs  97.89</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Remak</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
